<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Venaseta H1 shr falls.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Venaseta H1 shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share 3.98 bolivars vs 4.23 bolivars</p>
<p>Net profit 1.9 billion bolivars vs 2.0 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Revenues 2.1 bln bolivars vs 2.1 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Costs 67.9 million bolivars vs 20.9 million bolivars</p>
<p>Financing cost 79.9 million bolivars vs 74.2 million bolivars</p>
<p>NOTE: Period ends December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Results are consolidated and expressed in constant December 31, 1996 bolivars.</p>
<p>Venezuela's Venaseta CA is the holding company for textile company Sudamtex.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
